[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 117 Tommy's",
    "start": 1.53,
    "end": 5.592,
    "zh": "第117课 汤米的",
    "zh_hant": "第117課 湯米的"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "breakfast",
    "start": 5.242,
    "end": 6.332,
    "zh": "早餐",
    "zh_hant": "早餐"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 7.533,
    "end": 11.215,
    "zh": "听录音，然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "What does she mean by 'change' in the last sentence?",
    "start": 13.396,
    "end": 17.358,
    "zh": "在最后一句话中，她说“变化”是什么意思？",
    "zh_hant": "在最後一句話中，她說“變化”是什麼意思？"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "When my husband was going into the dining room this morning,",
    "start": 19.619,
    "end": 23.401,
    "zh": "今天早上我丈夫正要走进餐厅时，",
    "zh_hant": "今天早上我丈夫正要走進餐廳時，"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "he dropped some coins on the floor.",
    "start": 23.401,
    "end": 25.662,
    "zh": "他掉了一些硬币在地板上。",
    "zh_hant": "他掉了一些硬幣在地板上。"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "There were coins everywhere.",
    "start": 26.722,
    "end": 28.843,
    "zh": "硬币到处都是。",
    "zh_hant": "硬幣到處都是。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "We looked for them, but we could not find them all.",
    "start": 29.404,
    "end": 33.185,
    "zh": "我们找了它们，但没能全部找到。",
    "zh_hant": "我們找了它們，但沒能全部找到。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "While we were having breakfast,",
    "start": 34.466,
    "end": 36.647,
    "zh": "我们正在吃早餐时，",
    "zh_hant": "我們正在吃早餐時，"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "our little boy, Tommy, found",
    "start": 36.647,
    "end": 40.329,
    "zh": "我们的小男孩汤米发现了",
    "zh_hant": "我們的小男孩湯米發現了"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "two small coins on the floor.",
    "start": 40.009,
    "end": 42.43,
    "zh": "地板上有两枚小硬币。",
    "zh_hant": "地板上有兩枚小硬幣。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "He put them both into his mouth.",
    "start": 43.231,
    "end": 45.892,
    "zh": "他把它们都放进了嘴里。",
    "zh_hant": "他把它們都放進了嘴裡。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "We both tried to get the coins, but it was too late.",
    "start": 46.613,
    "end": 50.815,
    "zh": "我们俩都试图取出硬币，但太晚了。",
    "zh_hant": "我們倆都試圖取出硬幣，但太晚了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "Tommy had already swallowed them!",
    "start": 51.396,
    "end": 53.797,
    "zh": "汤米已经把硬币吞下去了！",
    "zh_hant": "湯米已經把硬幣吞下去了！"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "Late that morning,",
    "start": 55.298,
    "end": 56.779,
    "zh": "那天早上晚些时候，",
    "zh_hant": "那天早上晚些時候，"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "when I was doing the housework, My husband phoned me",
    "start": 56.599,
    "end": 60.281,
    "zh": "我正在做家务时，我丈夫从办公室",
    "zh_hant": "我正在做家務時，我丈夫從辦公室"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "from the office.",
    "start": 59.931,
    "end": 61.282,
    "zh": "打电话给我。",
    "zh_hant": "打電話給我。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "'How's Tommy?'",
    "start": 62.063,
    "end": 63.323,
    "zh": "“汤米怎么样？”",
    "zh_hant": "“湯米怎麼樣？”"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "he asked.",
    "start": 63.163,
    "end": 64.404,
    "zh": "他问道。",
    "zh_hant": "他問道。"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "'I don't know,'",
    "start": 64.104,
    "end": 66.385,
    "zh": "“我不知道，”",
    "zh_hant": "“我不知道，”"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "I answered, 'Tommy's been to the toilet three",
    "start": 66.085,
    "end": 69.647,
    "zh": "我回答说，“汤米今天早上已经去了三次",
    "zh_hant": "我回答說，“湯米今天早上已經去了三次"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "times this morning,",
    "start": 69.297,
    "end": 70.868,
    "zh": "厕所了，",
    "zh_hant": "廁所了，"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "but I haven't had any change yet!'",
    "start": 71.269,
    "end": 74.09,
    "zh": "但我还没有任何变化！”",
    "zh_hant": "但我還沒有任何變化！”"
  }
]
